bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Chapter commenting 1

actor User
boundary "Chapter Comment Form (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control CommentController
control CommentService
control UserService
entity CommentModel
entity UserModel
database MongoDB

CommentService -> UserService: 1. find user
activate CommentService
activate UserService
UserService -> UserModel: 2. findById(userId)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 3. Find user
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 4. return user data
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 5. return user data
deactivate UserModel
UserService --> CommentService: 6. return user data
deactivate UserService

loop User Not Found / User is banned
    CommentService --> CommentController: 6.1. Throw error
    activate CommentController
    CommentController --> Router: 6.2. 401 Unauthorized
    activate Router
    Router --> UI: 6.3. Show error
    activate UI
    UI --> User: 6.4. Show error
    activate User
end

CommentService -> CommentService: 7. Validate chapter_id
activate CommentService
space
deactivate CommentService

opt Invalid chapter_id
    CommentService --> CommentController: 7.1. Throw error
    CommentController --> Router: 7.2. 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 7.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 7.4. Show error
end

CommentService -> CommentModel: 8. Create new comment
activate CommentModel
CommentModel -> MongoDB: 9. save comment
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> CommentModel: 10. Saved comment
deactivate MongoDB
CommentModel --> CommentService: 11. savedComment
deactivate CommentModel

opt Failed to save comment
    CommentService --> CommentController: 11.1. Throw error
    deactivate CommentService
    CommentController --> Router: 11.2. 500 Internal Server Error
    deactivate CommentController
    Router --> UI: 11.3. Show error
    deactivate Router
    UI --> User: 11.4. Show error
    deactivate UI
    deactivate User
end